{
  "summary": "Stores local package tarballs and their download stamps in `WORK_PATH/local-sources` instead of `SOURCES_PATH`. This ensures generated snapshots remain isolated to each checkout's work directory while downloaded dependency archives continue to be shared.",
  "problem": "When multiple checkouts share a `SOURCES_PATH` cache, depends can reuse a local package tarball generated by a different checkout if that tarball has a newer mtime. In environments like Guix (`contrib/guix/guix-build`), where every checkout is mounted at `/bitcoin` and file mtimes are clamped to 2000-01-01, depends reliably reuses the wrong checkout's tarball without detecting source file changes.",
  "evidence": [
    "Commit message: 'Local packages... are built from a tarball of the local directory... stored in SOURCES_PATH next to downloaded sources. But unlike downloaded sources, it has no fixed name or hash identifying its contents, so when SOURCES_PATH is shared between checkouts, a checkout can find another checkout's tarball, see no newer files, and build from the wrong sources. This happens reliably with contrib/guix/guix-build...'",
    "PR description notes focused reproduction of the collision and verification of isolation."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "depends_on": [],
    "enables": []
  },
  "scope_notes": "",
  "changed_since_previous": "Replaced the previous approach (which appended a hash of the local checkout path to the archive filename in SOURCES_PATH) with moving local package archives and stamps entirely into per-checkout WORK_PATH directories, resolving collisions where checkouts share identical absolute paths like /bitcoin inside Guix containers.",
  "card": "This pull request moves depends local package archives and download stamps from SOURCES_PATH to WORK_PATH/local-sources. Previously, checkouts sharing a SOURCES_PATH cache could reuse another checkout's local package archive if its timestamp was newer, causing silent builds from stale or foreign source trees. This issue reliably affected contrib/guix/guix-build, where container paths and file timestamps are normalized. Storing local archives in the per-checkout work directory eliminates collisions while keeping downloaded external dependencies shared across builds. It addresses #35764.",
